label 24
text I clear my not-so-clean thoughts and look down on the list again.
text But in the end, there is only one teacher whom I'm close enough to ask.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Koumura, Koumura... here it is.)
text I find the name in the teachers' directory and dial the number.
text *Beep* *Boop* *Bip* *Boop*
text *Riiiiiing*
text ......
text *Click*
sound 3Y5.aac
text @[Voice]
text Hello, this is Koumura.
text It's grandpop's voice.
text @[Tomoya]
text Grandpop, it's me. I need something. Come to school tomorrow, okay? Gracias!
text @[Koumura]
text ...
sound 3Y6.aac
text @[Koumura]
text ...Wait.
text @[Tomoya]
text What is it? Can't you come tomorrow?
sound 3Y7.aac
text @[Koumura]
text It's not absolutely impossible if I try, but...
text @[Tomoya]
text Gracias!
text @[Koumura]
text ...
sound 3Y8.aac
text @[Koumura]
text ...Wait.
text @[Tomoya]
text Just what is it you want?
sound 3Y9.aac
text @[Koumura]
text I have plans during the holidays...
text @[Tomoya]
text It's all for your adorable student's sake. Delay them a bit.
sound 3YA.aac
text @[Koumura]
text But the plans are for my adorable grandchild's sake.
text @[Tomoya]
text I am objectively more adorable.
sound 3YB.aac
text @[Koumura]
text So you've finally forgotten how to feel shame.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh, that's nice...
sound 3YC.aac
text @[Koumura]
text Well, it's not like I can't delay my plans for one day...
text If I keep on pushing, Koumura will most likely accept my request. But if that means he'd have one less day to be with his grandchild, I'd feel so guilty.
choice Try another teacher|Keep on pushing
