text *KA-CHING*
text He was trying to say something, but I've already hung up.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, I don't know where you're going, but enjoy your time there.
text @[Tomoya]
text Not to mention we'd prefer a young female teacher over a senile old geezer any day.
text I start looking through the directory again, this time focusing on female names.
text @[Tomoya]
text (There's no one I can just make a casual request of...)
text @[Tomoya]
text (And now that I think about it, I haven't actually talked to anyone other than grandpop...)
text ...Mission failed.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Regrettably, Kouko-san would be the perfect person for the task...)
text But after all we've been through, we can't just let her meet Fuko like that.
text There is no other candidate.
text @[Tomoya]
text (It can't be helped...)
text @[Tomoya]
text (One of us is going to have to play the teacher...)
text If it's come down to this, I guess the teacher doesn't have to be an adult. As long as it feels like a real class.
