sound 3YM.aac
text @[Koumura]
text If an old geezer like me can be of help...
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes, you're just fine. As long as you can move around.
sound 3YN.aac
text @[Koumura]
text I'll try my best to.
text @[Tomoya]
text Excellent. Then I'll be waiting at school tomorrow.
sound 3YO.aac
text @[Koumura]
text What are we going to do?
text @[Tomoya]
text A class. You've just gotta stand at the teacher's podium like always.
sound 3YP.aac
text @[Koumura]
text So it's a classic literature class?
text @[Tomoya]
text No. You'll also be teaching English, math, science, and modern Japanese.
sound 3YQ.aac
text @[Koumura]
text Just so you know, there's no subject just called "science" in high school.
text @[Tomoya]
text And not just a single period. I want you to do an entire day's schedule.
sound 3YR.aac
text @[Koumura]
text Well... it's not impossible as long as I've got the textbooks, but...
text @[Tomoya]
text That's what I like to hear. I'll be waiting, then.
sound 3YS.aac
text @[Koumura]
text ...But─
text *KA-CHING*
text It seems like he was trying to say something, but the unstoppable momentum already made me put the receiver down.
text ...Let's pretend I didn't notice.
text Now we can hold the class. I can't help looking forward to tomorrow.
setvar intF[140] = 1
label 26
music ~
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s24
fi
goto 27
label s24
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 27
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
jump SEEN1503_0_0.scr
